# Google Gemini API Key (REQUIRED for AI features)
# --------------------------------------------------
# Get your FREE API key (takes 2 minutes):
# 1. Visit: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Sign in with Google account
# 3. Click "Create API key"
# 4. Copy and paste below (replace the example)
#
# Example: VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyA1B2C3D4E5F6G7H8I9J0K1L2M3N4O5P6Q
#
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Note:
# - Translation (🌐) works without any API key
# - AI features (💡 and 📝) require your own Gemini API key
# - Google Gemini API is FREE (1500 requests/day)
# - See API_SETUP.md for detailed instructions
